      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "52A8E26EF1BB7BAA",
      "text": "Mis clases no dejan a ningún alumno indiferente.\\n¿Crees que podrán aguantar el ritmo?[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "52A8DD6EF1BB732B",
      "text": "Si pasa cualquier cosa, me cubrirás las espaldas\\ny asumirás toda la responsabilidad, ¿no, cariño?[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
